      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i work for the city council and im trying to put together the weekly community newsletter. i need to mention the upcoming vote on the new congestion pricing zone in the downtown area. can u help me write a section for it? \n\nhere are the facts for the draft:\n- council vote is next tuesday\n- goal is to reduce traffic congestion and lower emissions in the city center\n- there's a fee for vehicles entering the zone during peak hours\n- local business owners are worried about the cost and impact on customers\n- some residents support it for environmental reasons",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
