      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it looks okay but i feel like the section on the business owners is a little weak compared to the rest. it kind of makes it sound like their concerns are just an afterthought compared to the \"groundbreaking\" environmental stuff. can you rewrite it so the business owners' concerns feel more significant and serious? like, emphasize the actual economic risk they're talking about so the newsletter feels more balanced?",
